WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Classify by Content, on the PC: a folder of 37 dummy documents and a demo keyword list. Nothing is uploaded.

00:07.000 --> 00:19.000
Start Processing: scans and a fax are read with local OCR. All 37 documents are done in about 4 seconds.

00:19.000 --> 00:28.000
The counters: 37 processed, 8 need review and 4 are errors, each with its reason.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
The results grid: category, confidence, pages read and keyword findings for every file.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
File Redaction: the active rule set lists five field types. The folder scanned is never changed.

00:39.000 --> 00:45.000
Three dummy forms: each copy is checked after it is written. Two are Redacted and Verified; one has fields to check.

00:45.000 --> 00:57.720
File Search indexes names and paths only, never contents: 'invoice' finds 3 files.
